# Generated report artifacts (Stage 6.2).
#
# `pnpm report:quarterly` and `pnpm report:grant` write here. Runs against a
# DEVELOPMENT database produce figures that are partial or seeded, and a
# half-real report sitting in the repository is one somebody eventually cites.
#
# A report generated against PRODUCTION and actually published is a different
# thing and should be kept: add it deliberately with `git add -f`, so that a
# figure quoted in a grant file can still be found a year later.
*.html
*.pdf
*.csv
!.gitignore
!README.md
